{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">吳啟華與內地前妻石揚子的愛女吳熙兒，轉眼間即將迎來18歲成人禮！自2024年國中畢業後，她便遠赴加拿大升學。近日她的最新近照罕有曝光，只見她已經長得亭亭玉立，蛻變成一位極具清冷氣質的美女，旋即引起大批網民關注！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-16 上午10.43.01.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026GqhX6NCjKN1789540005.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-16 上午10.43.01.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">相片可見，吳熙兒完美遺傳了父母的優良基因。身材高挑的她手長腳長，擁有令人羨慕的超模比例；五官方面更是無可挑剔，精緻的瓜子口臉、筆挺的鼻樑，加上一雙美麗動人的大眼睛，輪廓極深。難怪大批網民紛紛激讚她顏值極高，舉手投足都散發着濃濃星味，絕對有條件接力入行！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">除了驚艷的顏值，吳熙兒的百變穿搭亦是網民的焦點所在。自小熱愛打扮的她，經常戴名錶、孭名牌袋，行頭十足。最轟動一次是她曾赴日本旅行時，手挽一個價值約30萬港元的限量版手袋，加上平日私服也經常見到各大頂級奢牌的身影，一度被部分網民狠批她年紀輕輕就「炫富」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-16 上午10.47.56.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20269XGO8rfTSK1789540006.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-16 上午10.47.56.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-16 上午10.43.21.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026K1f37O11bc1789540006.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-16 上午10.43.21.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-16 上午10.43.49.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026gP2WjODL4y1789540006.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-16 上午10.43.49.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-16 上午11.00.50.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026khDqO8CovX1789540007.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-09-16 上午11.00.50.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T06:59:24.576171+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}